0..53 Comment "//! This source checks folds into path types of sets."
54..57 Comment "//!"
58..136 Comment "//! Integer and loop-word presentations have equal paths with equal endpoints."
137..198 Comment "//! The source compares folds whose arms use these set paths."
199..202 Comment "//!"
203..259 Comment "//! The checker compares the endpoints of each rule arm."
260..305 Comment "//! The kernel re-derives each resulting law."
306..385 Comment "//! A fold into the circle\'s loops, which are no set\'s paths, stays held to its"
386..406 Comment "//! arms as written."
407..410 Comment "//!"
411..446 Comment "//! - see: #427 — `plusCommAlong`"
447..484 Comment "//! - see: HoTT Book Definition 3.1.1"
